        <mxCell id="n9" value="THE JOIN THAT SILENTLY DROPS ROWS&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A test code is spelled differently in each table. Joining on test_code&lt;br&gt;loses four of the eleven test types and nothing looks wrong.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;FLICKER = VoltageFlicker = VOLTAGEFLICKER&lt;br&gt;POWER_FREQ = PFMF = PFMF&lt;br&gt;VOLTAGE_DIPS = VoltageDips = VOLTAGEDIPS&lt;br&gt;RS = RS_RI = RS_RI&lt;br&gt;RS_INTERIM exists on requests only." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF5F3;strokeColor=#A3341F;fontColor=#5C1D0F;" vertex="1" parent="1">
